Fabric Network Tool

This distribution includes modified portions of the Hyperledger Bevel Fabric
Helm charts under charts/, based on upstream commit
bd7a023fc65e0f642cb3b815aaa402529a4e7295. Hyperledger Bevel is licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0 and is available from
https://github.com/hyperledger/bevel.

The vendored chart files retain their original copyright and SPDX notices.
They were modified for namespace-scoped deployment, direct Kubernetes Secret
and PVC projection, restricted workload security contexts, and Fabric channel
participation/CCaaS operation by this tool.
